  m_Name: Surgeon Hawley
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.TrueEncounterData
  vendorName: Surgeon Hawley
  offerText: Sell me a pint of your blood and that comfortable medical cot in your
    corner. I will pay you handsomely. You will feel weak and miserable, but your
    wallet will be full.
  acceptResultText: Hawley draws the blood and his men take the cot. You feel dizzy,
    cold, and deeply depressed, but the thick stack of bills in your hand is entirely
    real.
  rejectResultText: You firmly refuse to bleed for cash. You feel safe and comfortable,
    though you miss out on the money.
